","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`'%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ'` 幸いフォーマットが素直なので、かつ Vim script は文字列同士を辞書順に比較ができるので、パースせずに時間の方を `strftime()` でフォーマットしてしまって文字列で順序比較する手はありそう\nまあ好みの問題もあるのでやってほしいとまでは言わないです。こういう手もあるな、くらいの意見だと思ってもらえると","ts":"1621072324.032600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qvRgP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c2dff2d-6bd6-41bf-910f-3405b1d4aea5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Python使うのが落としどころだと思いました","ts":"1621071788.030900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/yd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64e7060b-b4e8-4779-8f54-6eec97a589a7","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"他によい手があるなら教えてください","ts":"1621071775.030800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lVes7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3389bc71-4195-4a47-81f3-a2564395b614","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"自分で使ってない環境で動かなかろうが知ったこっちゃないのわかります","ts":"1621071648.030500","edited":{"user":"U03C71D7H","ts":"1621071656.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QOJ1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"619d07ac-6a0e-487f-b8be-187a1fed100e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"私はvitalでstrptimeのためだけに他のモジュールが入ってくるのが嫌","ts":"1621071625.030100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Z3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1253958e-09e6-46d6-b951-3bf0dd1dcf3a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"これがあるから Python には依存したくない","ts":"1621071616.030000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sXZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcc49b6c-a456-45e2-89e9-720217b57b0b","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"thincaさんがPython依存するのが嫌なように","ts":"1621071595.029700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_o